    "Block content on pages" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حظر محتوى في الصفحات"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Block content on pages"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bloquer du contenu sur les pages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocks Meta Pixel, Facebook and Instagram on other sites, Google Analytics, TikTok and other trackers, so they can't follow you from site to site. Pages open over HTTPS when the site supports it. Links lose tracking codes such as fbclid, igshid and utm_. The app switcher shows a blank screen instead of the page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يحظر Meta Pixel وفيسبوك وإنستغرام في المواقع الأخرى، وGoogle Analytics وTikTok وأدوات تتبع أخرى، حتى لا تتبعك من موقع إلى آخر. تُفتح الصفحات عبر HTTPS عندما يدعمه الموقع. تُحذف من الروابط رموز التتبع مثل fbclid وigshid وutm_. ويُظهر مبدّل التطبيقات شاشة فارغة بدل الصفحة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blocks Meta Pixel, Facebook and Instagram on other sites, Google Analytics, TikTok and other trackers, so they can't follow you from site to site. Pages open over HTTPS when the site supports it. Links lose tracking codes such as fbclid, igshid and utm_. The app switcher shows a blank screen instead of the page."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bloque Meta Pixel, Facebook et Instagram sur les autres sites, Google Analytics, TikTok et d’autres traqueurs, pour qu’ils ne vous suivent pas de site en site. Les pages s’ouvrent en HTTPS quand le site le permet. Les liens perdent les codes de pistage comme fbclid, igshid et utm_. Le sélecteur d’apps affiche un écran vide au lieu de la page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
